# 跨平台换行钉死为 LF。Windows runner 默认 core.autocrlf=true，
# 不写这条的话 checkout 会把文本资产改成 CRLF，preinstall 的 SHA-256
# 供应链校验会立刻红（CI 实测：wa-sqlite.cjs 0315bd7a… → 2c7bf32a…）。
* text=auto eol=lf

# vendored 供应链资产：字节必须与 scripts/audit/wa-sqlite-integrity.mjs 钉死的
# SHA-256 一致。cjs 是文本但禁止任何换行转换；wasm 是二进制。
packages/rxdb-adapter-miniprogram/assets/wa-sqlite.cjs text eol=lf
packages/rxdb-adapter-miniprogram/assets/wa-sqlite.wasm binary

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.eot binary
*.wasm binary
